 among the divided armies and  due to this confusion the army on the  south bank managed  to march way ahead of the two other  armies they decided to stop so the rest  of the army could catch up but that's  when the hungarians attacked in full  force destroying the entire unprepared  south bank army without the rest of the  army and even knowing about it  when night fell luthepol decided to make  camp somewhere near pressburg  or pratislava or pojon thinking he will  catch up to the south bank army tomorrow  however the hungarians under the cover  of knight crossed the danube and  attacked the unsuspecting frankish camp  killing most of the soldiers along with  leutbold himself  the next day the hungarians destroyed  the danubian fleet by setting it on fire  with fire arrows  and so the battle of presburg was over  hungarians had their decisive victory  and solidified their control over the  entire pannonian plane along with all  the people living in it  this battle made it clear to everyone  that the hungarians were here to stay  and so the next chapter of the hungarian  history began  the central european chapter  thank you for watching my video i hope  you're enjoying project pannonia the  video before mine in the collaboration  is by quillin inc history talking about  the avars and the video after mine and  the collaboration is by history time  talking about the christianization of  the now settled hungarians  if you enjoyed my video please consider  subscribing and stick around  for history  you
 

